    "description": "Parker Pen Company\nStainless Steel Pen and Pencil Set\nJotter Series, Vintage\nThis Parker Jotter writing set includes a matching ballpoint pen and mechanical pencil, both featuring the classic brushed stainless steel finish and signature arrow clips. Introduced in 1954, the Jotter series became an icon of functional Mid-Century design, praised for its streamlined profile and reliable push-button mechanism. This set is presented in its original black and white pinstriped Parker branding box.\nStainless steel barrel construction with polished chrome-tone accents\nSignature Parker arrow pocket clips and top-actuated push-button mechanisms\nSet includes one ballpoint pen and one mechanical pencil with original display box\nParker and Jotter branding visible on both the instruments and the packaging\nCondition:\nGood vintage condition. Both writing instruments appear structurally sound with no significant dents or scratches visible on the metal barrels. The clips are tight and aligned. The push-button mechanisms are intact. The original box shows light shelf wear and minor scuffing to the exterior surfaces, but remains structurally complete and holds the pieces securely.",
