    "description": "Hewlett-Packard (HP)\ndvd1270e LightScribe Multiformat DVD Writer\nManufactured July 2010\nThis HP external optical drive represents a significant era in consumer media technology, featuring the now-legacy LightScribe system. LightScribe technology allowed users to etch custom, silkscreen-quality labels directly onto the top surface of compatible discs using the drive's internal laser. As a multiformat recorder, this unit supports a wide array of optical media including DVDR DL and CD-RW, offering robust data archiving and media playback capabilities for legacy desktop and laptop systems.\nModel: HP dvd1270e (dvd1270 series)\nInterface: USB connectivity with integrated rear power toggle switch\nTechnology: LightScribe direct disc labeling and Multi Recorder R DL support\nManufacture Date: Verified July 2010 via original manufacturer serial label\nCondition:\nVery good physical condition. The matte black and silver-tone housing shows only minor surface scuffs consistent with light handling. The front bezel markings and brand icons remain sharp and clear. The disc tray door and rear ports appear well-maintained. Power adapter and USB cables are not included.\nPayment Extensions -\nDue to demand, we will no longer extend any payment deadlines.\nAuthenticated Items Returns & Refund Disclaimer -\nRefunds and returns must be inquired on within 7 days of receipt of item(s). Returns on authenticated items will be refunded the amount paid for the item (excluding shipping and handling) less a restocking fee.\nCustomer Service -\nCustomer messages are processed Monday through Friday between 7:00am to 3:00 pm EST. We strive to respond to all customer messages within 48 hours.  Inquiries about auctions ending in less than 24 hours may not be answered before the end of the auction.",
